                                                "sense_id": "25e1b698-2e81-3087-b2db-8ccd7cca4e61",
                                                "text": "\"A plain tomato cheese, two Hawaiians and a Coke,\" I told Greg, finally earning me a brief smile. […] Darrell paused to tear off a bite of ham and pineapple."
