                                                "sense_id": "25e1b698-2e81-3087-b2db-8ccd7cca4e61",
                                                "text": "Faced with a choice between the Supreme, the Hawaiian [...], the Capricciosa or the Meat Lovers', the bogan will invariably gravitate to the meal most likely to induce a fatal disease."
